Reading: closing the loop through the subsurface and the
compressor moves the CONVENTIONAL number violently — the
independence-uniform toolkit would report a different valley —
but it does NOT shrink the honest interval: the distribution-
free p-box still spans [0, 100], because the compressor's
corner p-box on reliability is itself [1.3, 99.9] %. The
decomposition names the physics: the subsurface loss at 1-yr
residence is a rounding term; the compressor's uncharacterized
alloy batches are the gate. For TRIERES: the euro is not in
the rock, it is in the reliability data — characterize the
high-pressure-stage alloys and the heat/dispensing contracts
FIRST. The p-box is the deliverable; the Sobol map says where
to spend to shrink it.
